items.summary:
On BookingFormPopup submission, do NOT navigate away or show a thank-you page. Instead, construct a URL-encoded WhatsApp message and automatically open `https://wa.me/918884447229?text=ENCODED_MESSAGE` in a new tab. The message must follow this format exactly:

Hello TrustFix,
I want to book a service.

Name: {Customer Name}
Phone: {Mobile Number}
Address: {Address}
Service: {Service Name}
Property Type: {Property Type}
Date: {Date}
Time: {Time}
Notes: {Notes}

All field values must be URL-encoded using encodeURIComponent.
